#: ../../source/templates_cursor.md:109
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cursor.md:110
msgid ""
"**Gothic compression for impact**: CursorGothic at display sizes uses "
"-2.16px letter-spacing at 72px, progressively relaxing: -0.72px at 36px, "
"-0.325px at 26px, -0.11px at 22px, normal at 16px and below. The tracking"
" creates a sense of precision engineering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cursor.md:111
msgid ""
"**Serif for soul**: jjannon provides literary warmth. The `\"cswh\"` "
"feature adds contextual swash alternates that give body text a "
"calligraphic quality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cursor.md:112
msgid ""
"**Three typographic voices**: Gothic (display/UI), serif "
"(editorial/body), mono (code/technical). Each serves a distinct "
"communication purpose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_cursor.md:113
msgid ""
"**Weight restraint**: CursorGothic uses weight 400 almost exclusively, "
"relying on size and tracking for hierarchy rather than weight. System-ui "
"components use 500-700 for functional emphasis."
msgstr ""

